    2 C      -2.152   -3.239    0.609   -2.231   -3.149    0.619   -2.193   -3.195    0.612    0.003
    3 N      -2.572   -4.502   -0.074   -2.740   -4.452   -0.192   -2.617   -4.640   -0.258   -0.184
